Component credits
-----------------

Named here because the credit belongs with the code, not only with the paper.

  Zhihao Li     GPU surface voxelization in sparc3d/ops, originally written as
                the pytorch-voxelization extension and implemented as Triton
                kernels for this release.

Third-party code redistributed with this package is credited separately in
NOTICE and THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.
